{"id":113,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"This purehearted Pokémon shares its eggs with the injured."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This species was once very slow. To protect their eggs from other creatures, these Pokémon became able to flee quickly."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"The egg Chansey carries is not only delicious but also packed with nutrition. It’s used as a high-class cooking ingredient."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"A gentle and kindhearted Pokémon that shares its nutritious eggs if it sees an injured Pokémon."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Because the eggs on their bellies have been overharvested by people in the past, the Chansey population remains very small."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It seems that other Pokémon’s efforts to take its delicious, nutritious egg away from it caused Chansey to get faster at fleeing."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Not only are these Pokémon fast runners, they’re also few in number, so anyone who finds one must be lucky indeed."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"The eggs laid by Chansey are rich in nutrients and a favorite food of many Pokémon."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Chansey lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"It lays several eggs a day. The eggs are apparently rich in nutrients and extremely delicious."},{"games":["X","Diamond"],"text":"It is said to deliver happiness. Being compassionate, it shares its eggs with injured people."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people."},{"games":["SoulSilver"],"text":"Being few in number and difficult to capture, it is said to bring happiness to the Trainer who catches it."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Natural Cure","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's status conditions are cured when it switches out."},{"name":"Serene Grace","hidden":false,"description":"Raises the likelihood of additional effects occurring when the Pokémon uses its moves."},{"name":"Healer","hidden":true,"description":"Sometimes cures the status conditions of the Pokémon's allies."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy"],"genderRate":8,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":140,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"urban","color":"Pink","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":440,"name":"Happiny","condition":null,"children":[{"id":113,"name":"Chansey","condition":"Level up, holding Oval Stone (Day)","children":[{"id":242,"name":"Blissey","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,111],[1,186],[1,204],[1,343],[1,383],[1,574],[4,39],[8,497],[12,791],[16,47],[20,374],[24,36],[28,505],[32,270],[36,113],[40,38],[44,135],[48,387],[52,361]],"machine":[59,34,280,523,347,204,886,605,574,38,409,89,604,283,203,263,126,7,53,374,411,416,447,356,270,63,304,58,8,196,113,118,182,94,240,156,157,317,201,247,285,214,883,76,446,707,500,164,241,129,36,851,168,87,9,86,85,885,352,528,428],"egg":[356,215,217,69],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv6-187","name":"Chansey","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"187","artist":"Toshinao Aoki","img":"sv6/187"},{"id":"sv6-133","name":"Chansey","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"133","artist":"HYOGONOSUKE","img":"sv6/133"},{"id":"sv3pt5-113","name":"Chansey","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Rare","number":"113","artist":"Taiga Kayama","img":"sv3pt5/113"},{"id":"sv1-144","name":"Chansey","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Common","number":"144","artist":"sui","img":"sv1/144"},{"id":"pgo-